  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "LLaVA-OneVision-2-Data",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tLLaVA-OneVision-2-Data\n\t\n\nTraining data for the LLaVA-OneVision-2 multimodal model family, covering large-scale video and spatial reasoning corpora used in mid-training.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Composition\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nSubset\nFormat\nDescription\n\n\n\t\t\nmid_training_video/60s_rest/\nWebDataset (.tar)\n10,809 shards of ~60s video clips\n\n\nmid_training_video/caption_v0/split_30s.jsonl\nJSONL\nCaptions for 30-second video clips\n\n\nmid_training_video/caption_v0/split_60s.jsonl\nJSONL\nCaptions for\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/mvp-lab/LLaVA-OneVision-2-Data.",
  "alternateName": [
    "mvp-lab/LLaVA-OneVision-2-Data"
  ],
